WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.420 --> 00:00:06.950
So protactinium, it’s quite difficult to
isolate, and the way people got hold

00:00:06.950 --> 00:00:11.710
of it was that the Atomic Weapons Agency had
to take 60 tonnes of

00:00:11.710 --> 00:00:15.740
waste radioactive material from which after
about 12 steps they

00:00:15.740 --> 00:00:21.610
eventually secured about 125 kilograms of
protactinium and this was the

00:00:21.610 --> 00:00:26.900
world’s supply of protactinium and it cost
them a lot of money to do that,

00:00:26.900 --> 00:00:29.400
so not many people have got access to this.

00:00:29.400 --> 00:00:30.410
You’ve never had it?

00:00:30.410 --> 00:00:35.050
No I have never had it. It’s also quite
radioactive so it’s quite hard to

00:00:35.050 --> 00:00:35.980
deal with in the lab.

